        },
        {
          "sourceColumn": "Short description of how you interact with this dataset.  ",
          "schema:value": "NEX-GDDP is a product of the NASA Earth eXchange, a research and technology team at NASA's Ames Research Center. When the nominator accepted the position of NEX Project Scientists in late-2022, they were aware of NEX-GDDP, but they had no idea how widely-used and impactful it had become. It was extraordinary to learn how many users of NEX-GDDP there are, and that they represent a huge cross-section of commercial, government, and academic users. They also really enjoyed seeing it become a part of the NASA public information content in the Smithsonian Museum of Natural History. Finally, it has been wonderful to present NEX-GDDP at start-up accelerators and other events and see the amazement on people's faces as they begin to comprehend that the data and code are open and accessible to anyone to build from."
        },
