71110; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/2571104; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/1871144; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/1854371; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/2469470; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/1871145; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/2204877; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/2475756; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/2229389; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/2204878; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/2469471; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/2571107; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/2229390; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/2204879; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/2204880; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/1832165; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/1881593; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/1881594; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/2204881; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/1881595; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/2571105; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/2469472; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/2469473; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/1881596; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/2204882; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/1881597; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/2469474; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/2571139; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/2571151; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/2571150; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/2571149; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/2571143; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/1993904; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/2229391; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/2229392; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/1984574; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/2229393; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/2229394; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/2229395; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/2229396; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/2229397; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/2229398; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/2229399; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/2229400; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/2229401; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/1871146; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/1984575; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/2229402; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/2229403; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/1985434; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/2229404; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/2229405; https://doi.org/10.17190/AMF/2229406; https://doi.org/1