          "schema:value": "Department of Environmental Science, Policy and Management, UC Berkeley, Berkeley, CA 94720\n\nLawrence Berkeley National Laboratory, UC Berkeley, 1 Cyclotron Road, Berkeley, CA 94720"
        }
      ]
