        {
          "@type": "agu:ReuseExample",
          "schema:text": "Nominator 6:\nThe IMERG reference publication has been cited 668 times (as of October 4, 2025). These citations describe a tremendous range of studies, from research to evaluate IMERG performance, to the use of IMERG as an input for other precipitation and climate monitoring products, to applications across the globe. It would be possible to assemble extensive bibliographies characterized by the different ways in which the studies have used the data. They are not going to attempt that right now, but a representative list could probably be assembled quite quickly."
