          ],
          "schema:citation": "Global/Regional Estimates (V5.GL.05.02): \nvan Donkelaar, A., Hammer, M. S., Bindle, L., Brauer, M., Brook, J. R., Garay, M. J., Hsu, N. C., Kalashnikova, O. V., Kahn, R. A., Lee, C., Levy, R. C., Lyapustin, A., Sayer, A. M., & Martin, R. V. (2021). Monthly Global Estimates of Fine Particulate Matter and Their Uncertainty. Environmental Science & Technology, 55(22), 15287–15300. https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.est.1c05309",
          "identifier": [
            {
              "@type": "schema:PropertyValue",
              "propertyID": "DOI",
