          "schema:value": "Masarie, K. A., Peters, W., Jacobson, A. R., & Tans, P. P. (2014). ObsPack: A framework for the preparation, delivery, and attribution of atmospheric greenhouse gas measurements. Earth System Science Data, 6(2), 375–384. https://doi.org/10.5194/essd-6-375-2014"
        },
