          "schema:value": "Huffman, G. J., Adler, R. F., Behrangi, A., Bolvin, D. T., Nelkin, E. J., Gu, G., & Ehsani, M. R. (2023). The new version 3. 2 global precipitation climatology project(Gpcp) monthly and daily precipitation products. Journal of Climate, 36(21), 7635–7655. https://doi.org/10.1175/JCLI-D-23-0123.1 \n\nHuffman, George J., Robert F. Adler, Ali Behrangi, David T. Bolvin, Guojun Gu, Eric J. Nelkin, and Yang Song. (2025). Algorithm Theoretical Basis Document (ATBD) for Global Precipitation Climatology Project Version 3.3 Precipitation Data. URL: https://docserver.gesdisc.eosdis.nasa.gov/public/project/MEaSUREs/GPCP/GPCP_ATBD_V3.3_Monthly.pdf \n\nGu, G., & Adler, R. F. (2023). Observed variability and trends in global precipitation during 1979–2020. Climate Dynamics, 61(1–2), 131–150. https://doi.org/10.1007/s00382-022-06567-9"
