          "@type": "agu:ReuseExample",
          "schema:text": "There are 30 peer-reviewed publications (thus far) currently highlighted on the ARTMIP project webpage. Researchers who use the ARTMIP database are eligible to submit their publications for highlight, so this number reflects both ARTMIP-organized publications and individual research efforts that use ARTMIP data. Note that the publications listed on our page do not necessarily reflect the number of publications that have indeed used ARTMIP data. Many individual researchers download data from the ARTMIP repository but do not necessarily contact us to be highlighted."
