          "name": "OpenTopography Facility, San Diego Supercomputer Center, University of California San Diego"
        }
      ],
      "landingPage": [
        "https://opentopography.org/"
      ],
      "inCatalog": [
        "id:repository:its-own-servers-i-think"
      ],
      "description": "OpenTopography has made it orders of magnitude easier to obtain high quality digital elevation models of various resolutions. They keep pushing the limits of what they can host, and support the community in processing (e.g., drone data). Their API is easy to link with, which helps other services that rely on the data."
