teleseismic P-wave receiver functions. Journal of Geophysical Research: Solid Earth, 131, e2025JB033040. https://doi.org/10.1029/2025JB033040 \n\nMestel, E. R. H., Illsley-Kemp, F., Savage, M. K., Wilson, C. J. N., Smith, B., & Hreinsdóttir, S. (2025). Seismicity from modern magmatic activity beneath Taupō volcano, Aotearoa New Zealand. Journal of Geophysical Research: Solid Earth, 130, e2025JB031644. https://doi.org/10.1029/2025JB031644"
