      "description": "OpenAQ is the world's largest open-source, open-access platform for harmonized, ground-level ambient air quality data. Its mission is to combat air inequality by making air quality data universally accessible for science, policy, and public empowerment. The platform aggregates and processes real-time and historical measurements from government reference monitors, research institutions, community organizations, and low-cost air sensors worldwide. \n - https://openaq.org/developers/platform-overview/",
