          "schema:value": "The nominator has worked with this dataset for more than three decades. It has been central to their research program, underpinning numerous publications. These porewater measurements have provided the empirical foundation for theories of marsh biogeochemical cycling and remain critical for ongoing analysis of coastal resilience."
        },
