          "schema:value": "A Zotero library of >3000 papers that cite Neotoma and its constituent databases is available here: https://www.zotero.org/groups/2321378/neotomadb/library. A Web of Science analysis of these papers (May 18, 2026) indicates that these papers collectively have an H factor of 149 and citations by >55,500 papers."
        },
