      "description": "This dataset comprises an analysis of the microalgae known as diatoms from the Yax Chen aquifer cave system in the Yucatan Peninsula, Mexico, spanning the time period May 2012–2017 when several tropical cyclones affected the region. Yax Chen is part of the peninsula’s extensive anchialine aquifer, which is the largest globally: The aquifer consists of a thin freshwater lens or meteoric water mass that is stratified atop a denser marine water mass that flows inward from the coast and is the primary source of freshwater across the peninsula, although it has been found to be vulnerable to environmental change. \nDiatoms are regarded as excellent bioindicators for modelling environmental change and water quality due to their high sensitivity, and have also been stated to be the most representative group of the phytobenthos. \n\nThe diatoms used for this dataset were collected from four sediment trap stations positioned along the length of Yax Chen as part of a more extensive ongoing environmental monitoring project. The sediment trap samples were collected from the sampling stations approximately every May following the dry season and December following the rainy season, from which the diatoms were then obtained and examined under a microscope. The Shannon Diversity Index (SDI) values, percentage of benthic diatoms, relative abundance of each species, overall diatom concentrations, and Si/Ti ratio as an indicator of primary productivity for each sample are included in the dataset.",
      "isReferencedBy": [
        {
          "@type": [
            "dct:BibliographicResource",
            "schema:CreativeWork"
          ],
          "schema:citation": "The gathering storm? An examination of diatoms as paleoenvironmental indicators of tropical cyclone activity that may have precipitated the Classic Maya Decline\" (http://hdl.handle.net/11375/32542)",
          "schema:url": [
            "http://hdl.handle.net/11375/32542"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7898-8122",
      "@type": [
        "schema:Person",
        "foaf:Person"
      ],
      "name": "Katelyn Mountjoy",
      "identifier": {
        "@type": "schema:PropertyValue",
