          "schema:value": "This dataset is a wonderful example of a multi-purpose, multi-institutional effort that combines one very specific goal (here: to validate data from a new satellite) with enabling new science. The data show detail-rich features of ocean circulation, internal waves, and mesoscale variability, and will take years to fully exploit. Combining this in-situ dataset with the data from the satellite that it helped validate, exciting new insights into ocean variability from large scales to the sub-mesoscale may be expected. For the nominator, it was a very rewarding experience to design, collect, and process the data, and to see the results on the satellite and new science trickling in."
        },
