          "schema:value": "The nominator is the project manager of the ArcticDEM and REMA projects. They helped develop the production pipeline to derive elevation models from satellite imagery in bulk using peta-scale HPC for their first 5 years. They’ve led the strategic direction of the projects since 2020, designed the cloud distribution strategy, and secured public releasability for the licensed products.\n\nThey don't interact with the datasets the way most people do, but they get to see the breadth of research and applications leveraging these transformative datasets. For the nominator, it's been the privilege of a lifetime to be part of delivering such valuable, openly-accessible products to the international scientific community and the public."
