            "dct:BibliographicResource",
            "schema:CreativeWork"
          ],
          "schema:citation": "Elipot S., R. Lumpkin, R. C. Perez, J. M. Lilly, J. J. Early, and A. M. Sykulski (2016), A global surface drifter dataset at hourly resolution, J. Geophys. Res.-Oceans, 121, doi:10.1002/2016JC011716.",
          "identifier": [
